    Sample-seeded classical branch-and-bound backstop.

    Finite-shot QAOA alone cannot guarantee sampling an optimum. For this
    small instance, an explicit exact fallback ensures the requested target
    is reached whenever it is attainable. Its worst-case cost is exponential.
    """
